@model PortalViewModel

<section class="brand-panel mb-4">
    <div class="row g-4 align-items-stretch">
        <div class="col-lg-7">
            <div class="portal-card h-100">
                <div class="section-eyebrow">Customer onboarding flow</div>
                <h2 class="h3 mb-3">What happens after the customer enters a mobile number?</h2>
                <div class="timeline-list">
                    <div class="timeline-item">
                        <strong>1. SMS OTP request</strong>
                        <p class="mb-0">The portal sends the OTP request to <code>http://10.89.4.49:9933/api/sendsms/sendsms</code> with originator <code>Emila</code>.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="timeline-item">
                        <strong>2. CRM profile lookup</strong>
                        <p class="mb-0">After OTP verification, the customer profile is loaded from <code>http://crm.talprd.com:9971/webservice.php</code> using <code>get_customer_profile</code>.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="timeline-item">
                        <strong>3. BRM inventory discovery</strong>
                        <p class="mb-0">The customer account number is used for BRM token retrieval and dashboard service-instance loading.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="timeline-item">
                        <strong>4. CRM line enrichment</strong>
                        <p class="mb-0">Each BRM service instance is resolved in CRM so the real <code>serviceinstance_msisdn</code> line numbers can be displayed.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="col-lg-5">
            <div class="portal-card h-100 accent-card">
                <div class="section-eyebrow">Configured real endpoints</div>
                <h2 class="h4 mb-3">Production-aligned integration targets</h2>
                <ul class="integration-list mb-0">
                    <li><span>Active Directory</span><strong>amc.al</strong></li>
                    <li><span>SMS OTP API</span><strong>10.89.4.49:9933</strong></li>
                    <li><span>CRM profile API</span><strong>crm.talprd.com:9971</strong></li>
                    <li><span>BRM auth + dashboard</span><strong>10.89.14.82:30010</strong></li>
                </ul>
                <p class="small text-white-50 mt-3 mb-0">Sensitive credentials remain externalised and should be provided through environment variables or user secrets instead of being committed into source control.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
